# Its id leads with aspect-: a State of the same name (Raging, Mindful, God Ki) has the bare one.
id: aspect-limited
name: Limited
polarity: negative
levels: true
max: 5
# [Solo]: its levels are not added between Transformations used together - the highest of them.
solo: true
# number: its script is the whole of it. moment: entering, leaving, the start of a turn (stages 4-5).
# rule: how a Transformation is entered, left or Mastered - asked by transformations.mjs aspectLevel.
group: moment
# The rule as read on 2026-11-12, in short; its own words (`text:`) to come from the user.
summary: >
  Entered through the Maneuver, you leave it after its level in Rounds; no Stress Exhaustion (unless Exhausting), but you cannot enter it again until the end of your next turn.

---

# Nothing it does by itself yet: its stage builds it.
